  <entry>
    <id>https://www.trackawesomelist.com/2015/02/23/</id>
    <title>Htaccess Updates on Feb 23, 2015</title>
    <updated>2015-02-23T21:43:28.000Z</updated>
    <published>2015-02-23T21:43:28.000Z</published>
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h3><p>Security / Prevent Framing the Site</p>
</h3>
<h3 id="prevent-framing-the-site"><a class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" href="#prevent-framing-the-site"><svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewbox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M7.775 3.275a.75.75 0 001.06 1.06l1.25-1.25a2 2 0 112.83 2.83l-2.5 2.5a2 2 0 01-2.83 0 .75.75 0 00-1.06 1.06 3.5 3.5 0 004.95 0l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 00-4.95-4.95l-1.25 1.25zm-4.69 9.64a2 2 0 010-2.83l2.5-2.5a2 2 0 012.83 0 .75.75 0 001.06-1.06 3.5 3.5 0 00-4.95 0l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 004.95 4.95l1.25-1.25a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06l-1.25 1.25a2 2 0 01-2.83 0z"></path></svg></a>Prevent Framing the Site</h3><p>This prevents the website to be framed (i.e. put into an <code>iframe</code> tag), when still allows framing for a specific URI.</p>
<pre><code>SetEnvIf Request_URI "/starry-night" allow_framing=true
Header set X-Frame-Options SAMEORIGIN env=!allow_framing</code></pre>]]></content>
