    <title>Htaccess Updates on Feb 12, 2015</title>
    <updated>2015-02-12T17:53:02.000Z</updated>
    <published>2015-02-12T17:53:02.000Z</published>
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h3><p>Rewrite and Redirection / Force non-www in a Generic Way</p>
</h3>
<h3 id="force-non-www-in-a-generic-way"><a class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" href="#force-non-www-in-a-generic-way"><svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewbox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M7.775 3.275a.75.75 0 001.06 1.06l1.25-1.25a2 2 0 112.83 2.83l-2.5 2.5a2 2 0 01-2.83 0 .75.75 0 00-1.06 1.06 3.5 3.5 0 004.95 0l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 00-4.95-4.95l-1.25 1.25zm-4.69 9.64a2 2 0 010-2.83l2.5-2.5a2 2 0 012.83 0 .75.75 0 001.06-1.06 3.5 3.5 0 00-4.95 0l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 004.95 4.95l1.25-1.25a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06l-1.25 1.25a2 2 0 01-2.83 0z"></path></svg></a>Force non-www in a Generic Way</h3><pre><code>RewriteEngine on
RewriteCond %{HTTP_HOST} ^www\.
RewriteCond %{HTTPS}s ^on(s)|off
RewriteCond http%1://%{HTTP_HOST} ^(https?://)(www\.)?(.+)$
RewriteRule ^ %1%3%{REQUEST_URI} [R=301,L]</code></pre>]]></content>
