  <entry>
    <id>https://www.trackawesomelist.com/2015/02/10/</id>
    <title>Htaccess Updates on Feb 10, 2015</title>
    <updated>2015-02-10T19:33:18.000Z</updated>
    <published>2015-02-10T13:40:22.000Z</published>
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h3><p>Miscellaneous / Auto UTF-8 Encode</p>
</h3>
<h3 id="auto-utf-8-encode"><a class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" href="#auto-utf-8-encode"><svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewbox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M7.775 3.275a.75.75 0 001.06 1.06l1.25-1.25a2 2 0 112.83 2.83l-2.5 2.5a2 2 0 01-2.83 0 .75.75 0 00-1.06 1.06 3.5 3.5 0 004.95 0l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 00-4.95-4.95l-1.25 1.25zm-4.69 9.64a2 2 0 010-2.83l2.5-2.5a2 2 0 012.83 0 .75.75 0 001.06-1.06 3.5 3.5 0 00-4.95 0l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 004.95 4.95l1.25-1.25a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06l-1.25 1.25a2 2 0 01-2.83 0z"></path></svg></a>Auto UTF-8 Encode</h3><p>Your text content should always be UTF-8 encoded, no?</p>
<pre><code># Use UTF-8 encoding for anything served text/plain or text/html
AddDefaultCharset utf-8

# Force UTF-8 for a number of file formats
AddCharset utf-8 .atom .css .js .json .rss .vtt .xml</code></pre><p><a href="https://github.com/h5bp/server-configs-apache" rel="noopener noreferrer">Source (⭐3.3k)</a></p>
<h3><p>Miscellaneous / Prevent Downloading</p>
</h3>
<h3 id="prevent-downloading"><a class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" href="#prevent-downloading"><svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewbox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M7.775 3.275a.75.75 0 001.06 1.06l1.25-1.25a2 2 0 112.83 2.83l-2.5 2.5a2 2 0 01-2.83 0 .75.75 0 00-1.06 1.06 3.5 3.5 0 004.95 0l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 00-4.95-4.95l-1.25 1.25zm-4.69 9.64a2 2 0 010-2.83l2.5-2.5a2 2 0 012.83 0 .75.75 0 001.06-1.06 3.5 3.5 0 00-4.95 0l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 004.95 4.95l1.25-1.25a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06l-1.25 1.25a2 2 0 01-2.83 0z"></path></svg></a>Prevent Downloading</h3><p>Sometimes you want to force the browser to display some content instead of downloading it.</p>
<pre><code>&lt;FilesMatch "\.(tex|log|aux)$"&gt;
    Header set Content-Type text/plain
&lt;/FilesMatch&gt;</code></pre>]]></content>
